flowchart LR
  Client[Independent frontend or API client] --> API[Nest Express API :3000]
  API --> PG[(PostgreSQL authority)]
  API --> Redis[(Redis public cache)]
  Provider[Stripe test or simulator] --> Inbox[Signed durable webhook inbox]
  Inbox --> PG
  Worker[Worker and schedulers] --> PG
  Worker --> Provider
  Worker --> MQ[RabbitMQ confirms and durable queues]
  MQ --> Worker
  Worker --> SMTP[Mailpit SMTP]
